{{Quote|A spear with three prongs, with water-related powers left infused.|Item}}
The '''Trident''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

It allows the user to use water based moves, and is a useful sword for mobility on land and late [[First Sea]] to early [[Second Sea]] grinding. However, it is outclassed by many Second Sea swords, which are generally considered better for all activities. 

==Obtainment==
The Trident can be obtained after defeating the [[Fishman Lord]]. It has around a 10% chance of dropping.

